    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7116" root="حج" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِجَّةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَجٌّ</span>, in four places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>A
year:</i> (S, Msb, K:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِجَجٌ</span>. (S, A, Msb.)
You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَقَمْتُ عِنْدَهُ حِجَّةً</span> [<i>I stayed at his abode
a year</i>], and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَلَاثَ حِجَجٍ كَوَامِلَ</span> [<i>three complete
years</i>]. (A.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَجَّةٌ</span>.

